      "empty": "No local fonts were returned. [lowkey]",
      "loadFailed": "Could not load local fonts: {error}"
    },
    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>User Guide</label><div><h5>Overview</h5><ul><li>Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>/: focus search (also via palette)</li><li>Enter in search: start search</li><li>ESC: close modals</li><li>Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Bangs: !g !ddg !bing !yt !wiki !maps</li><li>Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q} as placeholder</li><li>Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + loadout)</li><li>Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>Tiles</h5><ul><li>Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>+ Fave: add a new favorite</li><li>Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>Visibility per widget</li><li>Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>Backdrop</h5><ul><li>Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>Data</h5><ul><li>Export/Import as JSON</li><li>Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
